    "pubDate": "2026-08-20T08:29:25.000Z",
    "content": "<p><i><img class=\"alignright wp-image-14948\" src=\"https://codata.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/shutterstock_2641238559.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"591\" height=\"332\">An article&nbsp;illustrating the importance and benefits of the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14236140\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14236140&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1787300841836000&amp;usg=AOvVaw08gFBNraRoqUcgZ1k5OzUi\">data engineering</a>&nbsp;approach recommended by the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14236140\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14236140&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1787300841836000&amp;usg=AOvVaw08gFBNraRoqUcgZ1k5OzUi\">WorldFAIR Policy Brief</a>, was published on 19th August 2026 on the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.preventionweb.net/drr-community-voices/data-engineering-approach-tracking-global-climate-resilience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.preventionweb.net/drr-community-voices/data-engineering-approach-tracking-global-climate-resilience&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1787300841836000&amp;usg=AOvVaw38geFuEp1mo20nb8w1JOxy\">UNDRR’s PreventionWeb site</a>.</i><br>\n<i>&nbsp;</i><br>\n<i>‘<a href=\"https://www.preventionweb.net/drr-community-voices/data-engineering-approach-tracking-global-climate-resilience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.preventionweb.net/drr-community-voices/data-engineering-approach-tracking-global-climate-resilience&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1787300841836000&amp;usg=AOvVaw38geFuEp1mo20nb8w1JOxy\">A data engineering approach to tracking global climate resilience</a>’ outlines the challenges related to developing consistent, efficient, and accurate methods for assessing the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://unfccc.int/sites/default/files/resource/cma2025_19_a02.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://unfccc.int/sites/default/files/resource/cma2025_19_a02.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1787300841836000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2qSCdzr0itV6O_SyuXMZU6\">Belém indicators</a>&nbsp;(adopted at the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://unece.org/environmental-policy/events/unfccc-cop30\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://unece.org/environmental-policy/events/unfccc-cop30&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1787300841836000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2jQwOarAFjJswrQAto7G0B\">30th United Nations Climate Change Conference in November 2025</a>) for measuring progress towards climate resilience. &nbsp;Also described are how the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cdif.codata.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://cdif.codata.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1787300841836000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1JF3i7aa_NdexcNCoo6v2_\">Cross-Domain Interoperability Framework (CDIF)</a>, the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cdif4eosc.eu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://cdif4eosc.eu&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1787300841836000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2jnVNQ1yRR4tDIAHdDGgaP\">CDIF4EOSC project</a>&nbsp;and other tools and methods supported by&nbsp;<a href=\"https://codata.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://codata.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1787300841836000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3lSQvzfJCv6TOZDfa_Hgd7\">CODATA</a>&nbsp;can help realise meet these challenges.</i></p>\n<p><i>&nbsp;</i><br>\n<i>The article was written by Bapon Fakhruddin, co-chair of the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://codata.org/initiatives/task-groups/fair-data-for-disaster-risk-research/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://codata.org/initiatives/task-groups/fair-data-for-disaster-risk-research/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1787300841836000&amp;usg=AOvVaw39sPL7LQuCUk1_WAs4X826\">CODATA FAIR Data for Disaster Risk Research Task Group</a>, with input from Matti Heikkurinen, CODATA Project Portfolio Manager.</i></p>",
